id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-25T14:21:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T15:17:19Z","closed_at":"2026-06-29T15:58:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120640","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120640.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120640.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-29T15:58:39Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #119325\r\n- Closes #119346\r\n- _Bugsquad edit:_ closes #120099.\r\n\r\nFixes the issue whereby a `Label` using `custom_maximum_size` instead of `custom_minimum_size` to define its behavior would not expand vertically when shrunk horizontally whilst in autowrapping mode\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| <img width=\"165\" height=\"65\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f587e3c8-94e8-44bc-a7ba-b76395bc5c73\" /> | <img width=\"100\" height=\"172\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fae1c66f-412c-46e0-9dfd-25b2970eaaff\" /> |\r\n\r\nTest Project (from #119325):\r\n[no-clip-label-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29341107/no-clip-label-mrp.zip)\r\n\r\nFixes the issue whereby layout `Container` types, namely `BoxContainer`, `GridContainer`, and `FlowContainer`, would not allocate size to their children that have a desired size greater than their minimum size.\r\n\r\nLayout computation flow:\r\n1. Give each child its minimum size\r\n2. From the remaining space, distribute to children with a desired size greater than their minimum size based on the ratio of their desired sizes (i.e.  a child who desires twice as much space as another will get twice as much, regardless of how much they end up getting).\r\n3. If any, from the remaining space, distribute to children with the `SIZE_EXPAND` flag based on their stretch ratios. \r\n\r\nStep 2 is new, everything else stays unchanged. \r\nIn the case of `FlowContainer`, this process is actually much simpler, as we can just swap the desired size in for the minimum size, and then trim it back if there isn't enough space to fit it alone on a line/column. \r\n\r\nTest Projects:\r\n1. For a simple `Label` (from #119346): [container-desired-sizes-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29341125/container-desired-sizes-mrp.zip)\r\n2. For a layout with `SIZE_EXPAND` child: [respect-desired-sizes-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29341178/respect-desired-sizes-mrp.zip)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nBundled as a single PR since it's all related to the same system. Split commits for now, can squash if preferred.\r\n\r\nDiscovered this actually didn't need a more thorough rewrite of the sizing system, so getting it out now for maybe 4.7.1 cherrypicking. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120640/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120640/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}